            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: say the Marathi for missing, then the Marathi for to comb through."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ठिणगी",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ठिणगी — ṭhiṇgī — \"a spark\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "एक ठिणगी पडल्यास सगळं गवत पेटेल. ek ṭhiṇgī paḍalyās sagḷaṁ gavat peṭel. Should a single spark fall, all the grass will catch fire."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine. Plural: ठिणग्या, ṭhiṇagyā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "पडल्यास, should it fall, says जर … पडली तर in one word; plural ठिणग्या."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ठिणगी (ṭhiṇgī) is the everyday Marathi word for a spark; its origin is not settled."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
