            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "तेल पडल्यावर आग भडकली. tel paḍalyāvar āg bhaḍaklī. When oil fell on it, the fire flared up."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): तो भडकला, to bhaḍaklā."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Said of fire and of tempers: तो भडकला, he flared up in anger."
            }
          ]
        },
